# Must fail: a register specification with no title. rim:RegisterSpecificationShape is the only
# shape that can reject it: it proves that the shape runs on this register, as in the other three.
@prefix rim: <https://w3id.org/ogc/rim/> .

<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/specification-without-title>
    a rim:RegisterSpecification ;
    rim:definesSubstantiveChange "Any change." .
